verses.text:
As it stands written in Isaiah the prophet,{d}
“Look, I am sending my messenger ahead of you;
he will get your road ready.

A voice of someone shouting in the wilderness:
‘Make ready the way of the Lord;
straighten out the paths he will take.’ ”

so that
‘they may look and look, yet not perceive,
and hear and hear, yet not understand;
otherwise they might turn back and be forgiven.’ ”{c}
